{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/6a71035ba135d10ff6e897f8e5a65669.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/53f25a97e35de12d00aab022ff5b6a94.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/53f25a97e35de12d00aab022ff5b6a94.webm?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/53f25a97e35de12d00aab022ff5b6a94.mp4?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen, you have been conscripted by the <strong>Ministry of Purpose</strong> to work as a Terminal Operator at a classified containment facility in Westmont.<br>From your terminal, you will oversee every critical system. You will issue commands, maintain operational integrity, and monitor staff and subjects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a request. Your compliance is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your purpose begins now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/876e4e1771ec0b04b6b5eb230b89c90a.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/9f31735f70d65df56f7ab11ab2d6024a.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/9f31735f70d65df56f7ab11ab2d6024a.webm?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/9f31735f70d65df56f7ab11ab2d6024a.mp4?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All questions you may have can be answered by the Operator Manual available at your work station - NO communication with other staff at the facility in Westmont is permitted.<br>Terminal commands must be typed precisely. Incorrect syntax or typing errors can result in detrimental circumstances under time pressure.<br>From observing the facility, managing staff behavior, to initiating gas protocols \u2014 <strong>learn the role or be replaced.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Ministry of Purpose</strong> and <strong>The State</strong> have no tolerance for failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/6dea76ae6793324ae7e584a6403ae480.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/a47aee5ec35faed085ad6ea1e1cfe3f6.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/a47aee5ec35faed085ad6ea1e1cfe3f6.webm?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/a47aee5ec35faed085ad6ea1e1cfe3f6.mp4?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The security of the containment facility is the<strong> only</strong>\u00a0priority.<br>Monitor movements of staff and subjects in the facility, respond to request to open doors and initiate gas, purge and lockdown protocols when necessary.<br>Operators have reported anomalies and hallucinations, ensure you are focused on your purpose and nothing else.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/61b62ec070240706067d5aed7e15efe7.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/23a2608a6fb44d4d0a67c74969c837aa.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/23a2608a6fb44d4d0a67c74969c837aa.webm?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/23a2608a6fb44d4d0a67c74969c837aa.mp4?t=1767877756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to report or amend any irregular incidents will result in ramifications.<br>Gas leaks, power outages, door malfunctions and staff losses are likely to occur. Amending incidents to protect the facility is paramount.<br>Your purpose must be served with calm and efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/7894a59d36f7481fa2b90e6f45976709.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/3b8c8a2d0b0aa6a379476caea7b6d825.webp?t=1767877756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/3b8c8a2d0b0aa6a379476caea7b6d825.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breach is not failure, it is<strong> termination</strong>.\u00a0<br>Your one and only priority is the security of the containment facility. Under no circumstances should a subject be allowed to reach the entrance hallway to the facility.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no alarm, only silence.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077110?t=1767877756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077110?t=1767877756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/68c821cef73547704149aae7f57c1fc8ccfe6c0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767877756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/68c821cef73547704149aae7f57c1fc8ccfe6c0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767877756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mild jump scares with loud screams and sound effects."},"demos":[{"appid":4121630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/6a71035ba135d10ff6e897f8e5a65669.webp?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/extras/53f25a97e35de12d00aab022ff5b6a94.poster.avif?t=1767877756\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store